update clause_variant v set body = $body$APPENDIX TO PROPERTY CONDITION REPORT WHERE THE SELLER IS UNABLE TO COMPLETE IT

1.	It is hereby recorded that the SELLER is unable to complete the Disclosure due to lack of suitable knowledge.

2.	Notwithstanding anything contained in the Property Practitioner Act, the Purchaser hereby accepts the Property Condition Report, blank and incomplete, and buys completely at own risk, mindful of the right to appoint a building inspector of his/her own choice and at his/her own expense.

3.	The Purchaser hereby waives any claims against the agent as he/she may have otherwise had, due to the Property Condition Report Form not being completed.

4.	The parties hereby record that the Agent has not made any disclosures regarding the condition of the property other than:

{{agent_disclosures}}$body$
  from clause c
 where v.clause_id = c.id and c.key = 'condition_report.seller_unable' and v.label = 'Master';

