update clause_variant v set body = $body$The Seller hereby gives **Dream Knysna (Pty) Limited** consent to process my / our personal information, in accordance with the provisions of the Protection of Personal Information Act (“POPIA”), for all purposes relating to the carrying out of this mandate.  Such consent shall extend to the sharing, processing and retention of my / our personal information as authorized or required by law and shall extend to the sharing of my / our personal information with trusted legal advisors who may be approached for advice or assistance during the provisions of this mandate.$body$
