update clause_variant v set body = $body$**Section No {{section_no}}  in {{scheme_name}} (Door marked as No {{door_no}} in the building known as “{{building_name}}” as shown and more fully described on Section Plan Number SS {{section_plan_no}} in the scheme known as {{scheme_name}}, in respect of the land and building situate at Erf {{erf_number}} in the Municipality of Knysna and measuring {{extent_sqm}} square metres in extent**.

1.1	Together with an undivided share in the common property in the scheme apportioned to the said section in accordance with the participation quota as endorsed on the said sectional plan; and

1.2	Exclusive use of parking area marked {{parking_bay}} or as determined by the Body Corporate.
HELD BY Certificate of Registered Sectional Title Number {{title_deed_no}}$body$
